# Results > Visualization on a parallel run that was never reconstructed: the times come from processor*/ and the fields
# are put back on the whole mesh (decomposePar's maps), so the scene looks as it does for the serial run (t_viz)
open $SB/ws/cube3dpar
click nav:results
wait 2
click res-tabs#1
wait-until text Boundary surfaces timeout 30
assert text 0.5
assert not text No results yet
choose vz-add Section plane
wait 2
choose vz-add Streamlines
wait 3
assert not text No streamline left
assert not text isn't at time
screenshot $OUT/parallel.png
